* text eol=lf
# Images are bytes. The line above forces every file under build/ to text, and it rewrote the CR/LF
# bytes of the installer background on commit: the committed TIFF differed from the rendered one, and
# the sha256 gate in scripts/build-dmg-macos.sh compares against this very copy, so a clean clone would
# ship a broken picture with no error. This file overrides the root .gitattributes for build/.
*.tiff binary
*.tif binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
